The LineageOS oplus-fwk OplusBuild shim hardcodes VERSION.RELEASE="V12.1"
and resolves SDK_VERSION=24 from the legacy VERSIONS[] table with no
system-property read, so a genuine OplusOS 16 device (ro.build.version.oplus.api=38,
ro.build.version.oplusrom=V16.1.0) reports ColorOS 12. That version-gates off the
OS15/OS16 OEM feature surface -- most visibly the gallery OLive motion-photo
playback, whose PhotoOliveViewModel gates feature_is_support_olive on
OplusBuild.SDK_VERSION >= 33.

Mirror the stock OEM OplusBuild (OOS 16.0.8 oplus-framework.jar): read
ro.build.version.oplus.api for SDK_VERSION (returned only when > 33, else the legacy
table fallback), ro.build.version.oplusrom for RELEASE, and
ro.build.version.oplus.sub_api for SDK_SUB_VERSION. This yields the OEM-identical
runtime values SDK_VERSION=38 / RELEASE="V16.1.0" / SDK_SUB_VERSION=47.

Note: honestly reporting OS16 activates OS16 code paths that call OEM framework
classes the port has not yet restored (e.g. com.oplus.wrapper.hardware.camera2.*,
com.oplus.util.OplusPlatformLevelUtils); those must be ported alongside this change
to avoid NoClassDefFoundError in the camera and gallery. This commit is the
version-reporting half.

(cherry picked from commit 0f54be9d311cfe93c6bd49b04ed554bd2f65cc89)

Ledger: hardware_oplus.md Accepted Group C row 3 (0f54be9d)
Stub-matrix: task-9-stub-inventory.md row K08 — consumer: OEM apps gate features on OplusBuild version, known x4 lane APKs (dex-scan); location: modifies base oplus-fwk OplusBuild.java (base tops out V12.1/V12.2, SDK_SUB_VERSION 19)
Change-Id: I65c41ae7741929c0bf478c45fe1bad3d719b7a9a
---
 oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/os/OplusBuild.java | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/os/OplusBuild.java b/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/os/OplusBuild.java
index 98063290..5713459b 100644
--- a/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/os/OplusBuild.java
+++ b/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/os/OplusBuild.java
@@ -36,12 +36,16 @@ public class OplusBuild {
     private static final String[] VERSIONS = {"V1.0", "V1.2", "V1.4", "V2.0", "V2.1", "V3.0", "V3.1", "V3.2", "V5.0", "V5.1", "V5.2", "V6.0", "V6.1", "V6.2", "V6.7", "V7", "V7.1", "V7.2", "V11", "V11.1", "V11.2", "V11.3", "V12", "V12.1", "V12.2", null};
 
     public static class VERSION {
-        public static final String RELEASE = "V12.1";
+        public static final String RELEASE = SystemProperties.get("ro.build.version.oplusrom", "V12.1");
         public static final int SDK_VERSION = getOplusOSVERSION();
-        public static final int SDK_SUB_VERSION = 19;
+        public static final int SDK_SUB_VERSION = SystemProperties.getInt("ro.build.version.oplus.sub_api", 19);
     }
 
     public static int getOplusOSVERSION() {
+        int apiVersion = SystemProperties.getInt("ro.build.version.oplus.api", 0);
+        if (apiVersion > 33) {
+            return apiVersion;
+        }
         for (int i = VERSIONS.length - 2; i >= 0; i--) {
             if (!TextUtils.isEmpty(VERSION.RELEASE) && VERSION.RELEASE.startsWith(VERSIONS[i])) {
                 return i + 1;
@@ -81,6 +85,6 @@ public class OplusBuild {
     }
 
     public static String getVersionProp(String property) {
-        return "V12.1";
+        return SystemProperties.get("ro.build.version.oplusrom", "V12.1");
     }
 }
